Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 04:46:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 20/49] S020 (index): pack listings for repack route by pack
 ordinal

From the S020 incumbent (T2). ListPacksForRepack, when the bounded
single traversal does not apply, builds per-partition lists of entry
ordinals for the selected packs in one walk of a single final index
(repack_routes.go); in any other index state, and for ListPacks (check,
repair), the partition walk is kept and only selected locations are
materialised (repack_fallback.go, repack_ordinals.go).

New: internal/repository/index/repack_routes.go, repack_fallback.go,
repack_ordinals.go and their tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
